Short:        Converts IFF-pics to C-code (MorphOS)
Author:       Gauthier Groult & Jm Forgeas & Alfred Faust(MOS-porting)
Uploader:     alfred j faust gmx de (Alfred Faust)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      0.41
Requires:     MorphOS1.3 or higher (maybe it runs also at lower versions)
Architecture: ppc-morphos

This small tool converts iff-pictures into C-sourcecode.
It's very easy to handle.
Does batch-converting of multiple files.
It's also able to create C-source for sprites.
Can print the bitpattern of each plane as comments.

The program bases on the iff2c from Gauthier Groult & Jm Forgeas v.0.30.
The author enhanced it with a useful GUI and reworked it for MorphOS.

It comes with source.
Freeware & Public Domain

